# Hero showcase 3D models — heavy GLB binaries kept out of git history for now.
# The manifest (which files to place here + sources) lives in the committed README.
apps/kiosk/public/models/*.glb

# Point-cloud / Gaussian-splat assets — heavy, regenerated from the SOG scene by
# scripts/build-*.py (manifest: apps/kiosk/public/splat/README.md). Out of git history.
apps/kiosk/public/splat/*.ply
apps/kiosk/public/splat/*.bin
# .sog is the Spark-readable WebP bundle: 21MB for the 1.8M tier, 147MB for the full 12.4M
# one. See the splat README to rebuild either.
apps/kiosk/public/splat/*.sog
# EXCEPTION: the 1.8M tier IS committed (~21MB, same size as the PLY it replaces) so the
# deployed showreel has a campus to fly through at all. The 12.4M tier stays out — 147MB of
# git history, re-downloaded on every cold load, needs object storage instead.
!apps/kiosk/public/splat/tum-campus.sog
# EXCEPTION: the decimated web splat (~21MB, 400k gaussians, no SH) IS committed so the
# deployed showreel landing has its campus. Regenerate via the README.
!apps/kiosk/public/splat/tum-campus-web.ply
apps/kiosk/public/roofmap.png

# Local report/backup exports (large ply/png), not part of the app
report/
